==English==
{{was wotd|2023|February|22}}

===Etymology===
From the notion that consumption of beer and other alcoholic beverages causes people to see things differently, as if wearing a type of goggles.<ref>Compare {{R:OED Online|subpos=n|subid=24678897|entry=beer|pos=''n.''{{sup|1}}|noformat=1|id=16986|date=September 2022}}</ref><ref>{{R:Dictionary.com|pos=plural n|source=Random House}}</ref>

